        metaTitle: 'Food Delivery App in Somalia | How to Start (2026 Guide)',
        description:
            'How to start a food delivery app business in Somalia: the three apps you need, restaurant and rider partners, mobile money payments, delivery without street addresses, and launching in Mogadishu.',
